('127.602.d.6.D',3,'Changes such as online booking and international travel reflect the changing global:','["climate", "menu", "workplace", "weather"]'::jsonb,2,'Technology and travel shape modern hospitality.','original'),
('127.602.d.6.D',4,'Because guests now come from many countries, hospitality workers benefit from learning about other:','["time zones only", "uniform brands", "tax rates only", "cultures"]'::jsonb,3,'Cultural awareness improves service.','original'),
