('127.602.d.7.A',4,'Earning an industry certificate while working can help an employee qualify for a:','["penalty", "promotion", "layoff", "suspension"]'::jsonb,1,'Certification shows added skills.','original'),
('127.602.d.7.B',3,'A professional way to leave a job is to put your resignation in writing and give:','["no warning", "an insult", "proper notice", "a complaint post"]'::jsonb,2,'Proper notice keeps a good reputation.','original'),
('127.602.d.7.B',4,'To secure a job, an applicant should prepare a resume, complete applications, and practice for the:','["vacation", "tax audit", "lottery", "interview"]'::jsonb,3,'Interviews decide who is hired.','original'),
