('127.602.d.8.A',4,'Cleaning rooms and handling linens is the function of which hotel department?','["sales", "housekeeping", "front office", "accounting"]'::jsonb,1,'Housekeeping keeps rooms ready for guests.','original'),
('127.602.d.8.B',3,'An employee who shows proficiency in a department can perform its duties accurately and:','["carelessly", "slowly", "independently", "rarely"]'::jsonb,2,'Proficiency means skilled, reliable work.','original'),
('127.602.d.8.B',4,'Handling reservations, check-in, and billing are core duties of the hotel''s:','["laundry", "engineering department", "banquet kitchen", "front office"]'::jsonb,3,'The front office manages guest records and payments.','original'),
