('127.602.d.9.A',3,'Terms like ''occupancy,'' ''rack rate,'' and ''no-show'' are examples of job-specific technical:','["recipes", "uniforms", "vocabulary", "furniture"]'::jsonb,2,'Each field has its own terms.','original'),
('127.602.d.9.A',4,'A guest who reserves a room but never arrives or cancels is called a:','["early bird", "upgrade", "walk-in", "no-show"]'::jsonb,3,'No-shows can cost a hotel revenue.','original'),
