('127.603.d.2',3,'A reservation system crashes during check-in. A calm, logical approach is to use a backup process while staff work to:','["guess at rates", "blame guests", "identify and fix the cause", "close the hotel"]'::jsonb,2,'Problem solving finds causes and solutions.','original'),
